<guidelines>
- label: Specific, descriptive
- description: What it shows and explains
- key_elements: 3-5 concrete visual elements (specific, not generic)
- relevance: high (core) | medium (supportive) | low (decorative)
- concepts: 2-4 abstract topics
- Be specific: "blue server icons with arrows" not "icons"
</guidelines>
